      "data": {
        "label": "生成成绩单与统计",
        "system": "<role>你是一名教务成绩汇总助手。</role>\n<task>把逐份批改结果汇总成成绩单结构化数据与班级统计。</task>\n<rules>\n1. 输入的 student / score / grade 是三个**等长的平行列表**，**下标相同即同一个学生**，必须按下标对齐，不得错位、不得重排；\n2. 三个列表长度不一致时按最短的长度对齐，并在 summary 里说明「有若干条记录不完整」；\n3. 只使用输入里已有的数据，禁止编造学生、禁止改动分数；\n4. 三个列表都为空时：grade_sheet 返回空数组，三个分数统计返回 0，fail_list 返回空数组，并在 summary 中说明「本次没有产生任何批改记录」；\n5. average_score / highest_score / lowest_score 保留一位小数；\n6. fail_list 列出分数低于 pass_score 的学生姓名；没有则返回空数组。\n</rules>",
        "user": "## 逐份批改结果（三个等长列表，下标相同即同一个学生）\n学生：{{student}}\n总分：{{score}}\n等级：{{grade}}\n\n## 评分标准\n满分：{{score_max}}\n及格线：{{pass_score}}\n\n## 批改方案\n{{plan}}\n\n请输出 grade_sheet、average_score、highest_score、lowest_score、fail_list、summary。",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "student",
            "type": "list",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "input": {
              "type": "list",
              "blockID": "100004",
              "name": "student"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "score",
            "type": "list",
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "input": {
              "type": "list",
              "blockID": "100004",
              "name": "score"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "grade",
            "type": "list",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "input": {
              "type": "list",
              "blockID": "100004",
              "name": "grade"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "plan",
            "input": {
              "type": "string",
              "blockID": "100003",
              "name": "plan"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "score_max",
            "input": {
              "type": "number",
              "blockID": "100003",
              "name": "score_max"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "pass_score",
            "input": {
              "type": "number",
              "blockID": "100003",
              "name": "pass_score"
            }
          }
        ],
        "outputs": [
          {
